      "en": "In those days, she became sick and died. When they had washed her, they laid her in an upper room.",
      "ko": "그 때에 병들어 죽으매 시체를 씻어 다락에 뉘우니라",
      "source_text_hash": "1ea51924e437b33f06890e468b8369b51486e24a7e0c30dd640bbf4450637d3a",
