      "en": "As Lydda was near Joppa, the disciples, hearing that Peter was there, sent two men to him, imploring him not to delay in coming to them.",
      "ko": "룻다가 욥바에 가까운지라 제자들이 베드로가 거기 있음을 듣고 두 사람을 보내어 지체말고 오라고 간청하니",
      "source_text_hash": "265b9e418994a71e72a40252a2deb6af363158d0215009085fc2185b1d3e5a5a",
      "translation_text_hash": "2ab4fb413735e39ce57a841aeae79e50c9fb93cd7f1a6db29fb4e179c8583c8e",
